Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.10,0:00:03.45,Note,0,0,0,0,,（忆往昔）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.45,0:00:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're a what?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.13,0:00:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,英格兰的记录者吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're, uh, English Men of Letters?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.77,0:00:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不列颠\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭British.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.50,0:00:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想跟你们合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wanna work with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.86,0:00:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 米克吧 - 我的号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh, Mick, is it? - My number.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.28,0:00:17.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we think?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.08,0:00:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,要相信英国佬那套「我们做朋友吧」的话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we buying that Brit's whole "Let's be friends" routine?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.09,0:00:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.81,0:00:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,温家兄弟 他们不比他们控制不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Winchesters are no better than the monsters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.82,0:00:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些怪物强到哪去\N{\fnArial\fs30}they fail to control.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.98,0:00:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们该被铲除\N{\fnArial\fs30}They need to be eliminated.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.38,0:00:26.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种事可以留给凯奇先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we have Mr. Ketch for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.97,0:00:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我收拾了温家兄弟留下的麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cleaned up the Winchesters' mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们猜中了 他们没能完成任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}As suspected, they couldn't finish the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.42,0:00:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 凯奇先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Mr. Ketch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.50,0:00:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的晚餐男伴多金 单身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dinner date is loaded, single,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.82,0:00:36.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,很可能还有健康问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}and possibly in delicate health.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.60,0:00:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我抛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my chance to leave behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.09,0:00:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪物 恶魔和潮湿藏身处的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}monsters and demons and moldy hideouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.67,0:00:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法 皮囊是文斯·文森特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer wearing Vince Vincente.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.63,0:00:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…还算有名\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're…kind of famous.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.89,0:00:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,勇往直前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Onward and upward.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.24,0:00:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他才一个个地换皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why he's jumping from vessel to vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.60,0:00:53.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到他就是我的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me finding him is my responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.62,0:00:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 你会需要支援的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass, you're gonna want some backup on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.84,0:00:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果你们困住了路西法 需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you get Lucifer cornered and find yourself in need,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.80,0:00:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.85,0:01:01.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡跟克劳力搭伙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass is chumming it up with Crowley.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.27,0:01:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在一起追踪路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're hunting Lucifer together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.28,0:01:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,毛毛和我都难舍难分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feathers and I are all but inseparable.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.00,0:01:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,又一起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Together again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.87,0:01:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.79,0:01:13.16,Note,0,0,0,0,,（如今）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.19,0:01:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为前所未见的干旱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And in the unprecedented drought condition…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.42,0:01:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,本州农民担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}farmers in the state worry that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.94,0:01:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,来年的作物将全部颗粒无收\N{\fnArial\fs30}the entirety of next year's crop could be lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.81,0:01:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这促使了世界范围内的涨价\N{\fnArial\fs30}driving up prices worldwide.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.25,0:01:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一则新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}In other news,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.30,0:01:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方在调查亿万富翁和慈善家\N{\fnArial\fs30}police are investigating the mysterious death.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.33,0:01:33.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,华莱士·帕克的神秘死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}of billionaire philanthropist Wallace Parker.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.24,0:01:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕克上周二被发现死于办公室中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Parker was found dead in his office late Tuesday,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.20,0:01:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他的尸体严重受损 - 关掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- his body heavily damaged… - Turn that off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.83,0:01:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎遭遇了爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}by an explosion of some ki…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.62,0:01:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们最好还是专注于主的事务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better we stay focused on the Lord's work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.39,0:01:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.34,0:01:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, Your Excellency.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.14,0:01:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕克先生的事真是遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a shame about Mr. Parker.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.08,0:01:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他是您朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know he was a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.89,0:01:58.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,更不用说还是我们最大的资助人之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not to mention, one of our biggest donors.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.21,0:02:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.95,0:02:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第12季第8集]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.41,0:02:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的同事已经到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your colleagues are already inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.09,0:02:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 探员 - 探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Agents. - Agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.91,0:02:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 这真是够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, this has gotta stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.47,0:02:56.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, give me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.38,0:02:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿玛尼的 - 行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Armani! - Okay, enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.73,0:02:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们看看吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.37,0:03:06.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,某人忘记擦防晒霜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like somebody forgot to put on his sunscreen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.85,0:03:08.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是华莱士·帕克\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was Wallace Parker,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.94,0:03:12.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,几乎执行总裁了一切 很有势力\N{\fnArial\fs30}the very powerful CEO of almost everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.36,0:03:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来 也是路西法的最新一具皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And apparently, Lucifer's latest vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.06,0:03:17.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不足以支撑住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wasn't strong enough to hold him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.16,0:03:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法不满足于\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer's not content with slutting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.00,0:03:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,一具具地换普通皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}from one random vessel to the next.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.34,0:03:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他开始选绩优股了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's moving on to blue chips …
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.15,0:03:28.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,名人 业内领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}celebrities, captains of industry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.45,0:03:30.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,他变得更加危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just got a lot more dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.10,0:03:32.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同意扎帕探员的看法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agree with Agent Zappa.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.67,0:03:34.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你够了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, will you stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.72,0:03:38.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,有发现吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, find anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.05,0:03:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,有哪位有权有势的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone powerful or respectable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.96,0:03:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,突然画风大变 或爆炸了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}who suddenly changed… or exploded?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.93,0:03:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个挺有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is pretty interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.26,0:03:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是圣路易斯的大主教\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the Archbishop of St. Louis.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.56,0:03:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟华莱士·帕克的合照\N{\fnArial\fs30}with Wallace Parker.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.07,0:03:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 这是三天前的他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So? - So that was him three days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.14,0:03:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.66,0:03:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,是昨晚的他 在一家施粥场开幕式上\N{\fnArial\fs30}is him last night at the opening of a food kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.54,0:03:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现少了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Notice anything missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.27,0:04:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 老大个的那个十字架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, the big mother of a cross around his neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.26,0:04:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 今早\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly. And this morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.73,0:04:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的办公室取消了所有其他公共活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}his office canceled all further public appearances.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.10,0:04:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,且未作出解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}without comment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.49,0:04:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so you're thinking that, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.84,0:04:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法从帕克出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer blasted out of Parker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.04,0:04:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,进入了他的朋友大主教体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}and into his buddy the Archbishop here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.79,0:04:17.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 值得一试 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Worth a shot. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.57,0:04:26.16,Note,0,0,0,0,,（圣路易斯大主教区）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.46,0:04:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's awfully quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.52,0:04:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我给办公室主任打了好几通电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I put in a dozen calls to the Chief of Staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.14,0:04:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人接\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.86,0:04:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we'll have a look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.33,0:04:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果是路西法 再把其他人叫来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it is Lucifer, we'll call the rest of the Scooby gang.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.14,0:04:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.22,0:05:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,神父\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.38,0:05:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.82,0:05:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就觉得不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}We… knew something was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.02,0:05:33.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他…\N{\fnArial\fs30}He… he…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.51,0:05:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,大主教\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Archbishop?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.66,0:05:50.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,高级职员决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Senior staff decided…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.33,0:05:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,内部解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}handle internally.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.74,0:05:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,进行干涉\N{\fnArial\fs30}and intervene.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.00,0:05:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,驱魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}An exorcism.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.65,0:07:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我同意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I agree to this,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.12,0:07:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就是搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}we would be partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.33,0:07:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,为美国带来真正的灵性时代\N{\fnArial\fs30}We would bring a true era of spirituality to America.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.26,0:07:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,治愈它的创伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}and heal her wounds?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.79,0:07:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,那哈利路亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then hallelujah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.28,0:07:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恭敬地接受你的指引\N{\fnArial\fs30}I humbly accept your guidance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.55,0:07:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.92,0:08:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swell.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.25,0:08:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.50,0:08:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 杰夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, then, Jeff.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.02,0:08:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一般会给我的宿主更多休息时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Usually, I give my hosts more downtime,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.04,0:08:40.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这次 就高调行事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}but in this case, high-profile as it is…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.99,0:08:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可能需要帮助调整一些…规程\N{\fnArial\fs30}I may need help fine-tuning some…protocols.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.80,0:08:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样我才能做到我所承诺的\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I'm going to deliver on all the goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.75,0:08:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些善事和公共服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}and public service that I promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.71,0:08:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很乐意帮忙 搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm … I'm happy to help, partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.65,0:09:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要在这里参加一系列筹款活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're appearing at … at a series of fundraisers here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.45,0:09:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一群很棒的助理在帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}backed by a fantastic group of aides.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.81,0:09:05.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只需要关注大局喽\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I just focus on the big picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.17,0:09:08.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,由团队处理细节问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}The team handles the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.37,0:09:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 杰夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, listen, Jeff,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.86,0:09:13.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些消息是非常有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is all useful information, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.62,0:09:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 如果我们想做好\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…if we're gonna pull this off,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.65,0:09:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要更多私人细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna need a few more personal details.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.04,0:09:24.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们需要相信我就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}People need to believe that I am, in fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.67,0:09:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}President of the United States.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.94,0:09:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,前一刻我们还在探讨最好的烤肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}One minute, we're talking about the best barbecue.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.93,0:10:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢堪萨斯城\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a Kansas City man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.63,0:10:04.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,比尔喜欢孟菲斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill likes Memphis.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.15,0:10:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去了厕所\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stepped into the john.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.16,0:10:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来时 他已经倒地了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I came out, he was on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.80,0:10:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给他做了心肺复苏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, uh, I tried CPR, but, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.20,0:10:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信您已经尽力了 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure you did everything you could, Sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.77,0:10:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他似乎是发生了严重的脑出血\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it appears he had a massive cerebral hemorrhage.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.26,0:10:20.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得做尸检\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna need an autopsy,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.58,0:10:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我看不出谋杀的迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I don't see any evidence of foul play.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.18,0:10:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,您想说两句吗 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'd like to say a few words, Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.20,0:10:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,对天上的那位说两句 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few words to the man upstairs, Sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.07,0:10:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像您每天早晨那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}like you do every morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.87,0:10:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.13,0:10:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,说两句\N{\fnArial\fs30}Words.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.69,0:10:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们无论说什么似乎都不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing we ever say feels like enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.52,0:11:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Babies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.86,0:11:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就是孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.67,0:11:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,无辜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Innocents.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.41,0:11:12.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都在努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of us struggling to…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.72,0:11:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,正直行事 目标明确 充满骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}walk upright with purpose and … and pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.05,0:11:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们需要「天父」\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet, we need "Our Father"…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.45,0:11:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}to…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.38,0:11:26.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,接住摔倒的我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}be there when we fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.45,0:11:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天 我们失去了一个兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today, we lost a brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.31,0:11:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天 我们将继续为国效力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow, we will continue our work for the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.54,0:11:41.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿门 - 阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Amen. - Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.71,0:11:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总是知道该说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always know the right thing to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.33,0:12:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}These pictures…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.53,0:12:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,如此的暴力 根本没必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}The level of violence, it's completely unnecessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.85,0:12:11.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法不喜欢别人招惹他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer doesn't like to get messed with.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.17,0:12:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜当大主教手下的牧师\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess when the Archbishop's priests.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.60,0:12:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现他被附身后\N{\fnArial\fs30}figured out he was possessed,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.18,0:12:18.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想低调处理 自己驱魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}they tried to keep it quiet, do an exorcism.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.88,0:12:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然本来也不会好使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, not that it would've worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.44,0:12:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer blew town,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.48,0:12:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还是先杀了所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but not before he slaughtered the entire staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.45,0:12:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们查对了 但他现在去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we were on the right trail. Where's it go now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.37,0:12:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.19,0:12:32.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁赢了诺贝尔和平奖 我们从那儿查起吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who won the Nobel Peace Prize? Why don't we start there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.17,0:12:36.89,Note,0,0,0,0,,（福斯特庄园 总统宅院）
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.37,0:12:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不在华府期间 白俄罗斯那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}While we've been away from from D.C., in Belaurus,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.68,0:12:43.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛军和政府的谈判\N{\fnArial\fs30}negotiations between rebel forces and the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.77,0:12:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}have broken down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.90,0:12:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要把哈肯大使召回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're recalling Ambassador Harkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.23,0:12:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 是不是该让联合国插手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, is it time to involve the U.N.?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.73,0:12:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者 我们可以直接一个核弹轰了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}That or we can just go ahead and nuke 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.69,0:13:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 2点有蒙特罗伊筹款活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well! Montroy fundraiser at 2:00.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.42,0:13:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚餐时再说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll pick this up at dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.19,0:13:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.91,0:13:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,您可能想知道 新民调结果已经出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought you might want to know, the new poll numbers are out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.95,0:13:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,您支持率很高\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're way up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.05,0:13:36.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是近代以来最受欢迎的在任总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officially the most popular sitting President in modern history.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.36,0:13:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.58,0:13:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.92,0:13:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥图\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Otto…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.69,0:13:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,去休息一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}take a little break.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.12,0:13:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was there something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.70,0:13:59.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.93,0:14:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.70,0:14:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像我从来没做过\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's almost like I've never done that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.75,0:14:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.30,0:14:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰夫 我得承认\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Jeff, I admit…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.97,0:14:18.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,保密还挺刺激的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it makes things kind of exciting keeping this a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.52,0:14:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.34,0:14:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以把对彼此的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}we could make how we feel about each other…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.07,0:14:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,公诸于众\N{\fnArial\fs30}well, public.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.68,0:14:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.80,0:14:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家可能不会赞同的\N{\fnArial\fs30}people might not like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.53,0:14:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你是鳏夫 公众可能不会接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Public might not like it because you're a widower.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.53,0:14:43.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.70,0:14:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道露易丝死后你一直很寂寞\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you've been lonely since Louise died.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.41,0:14:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也知道你对我的感情是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know your feelings for me are real,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.04,0:14:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你做的一切都是真诚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}because everything you do is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.04,0:15:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just love to think that…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.04,0:15:05.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}someday…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.09,0:15:09.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以成为真正的一对儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}we could be a real couple.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.72,0:15:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许结个婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe do the wedding thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.67,0:15:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许生个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the baby thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.30,0:15:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.23,0:15:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你肯定会成为个好父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just know you'd make an amazing father.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.23,0:15:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,好姑娘 真准时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good girl. You're right on time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.91,0:15:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.29,0:16:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续这么听话 你或许真能把灵魂赎回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep this up and you could actually earn back your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.32,0:16:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天有什么消息告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}What little tidbit do you have for me today?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.41,0:16:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚有一起死亡被我判为自然死亡 但…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a death last night that I ascribed to natural causes, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.03,0:16:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那绝对不是自然的\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was anything but natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.72,0:16:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,地堡的符文坏掉了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did the Bunker's warding fail?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.91,0:16:16.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我关掉了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just powered it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.93,0:16:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力打来了 说有关于路西法的重要消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley called, said he had some big news about Lucifer,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.23,0:16:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁知道是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever the hell that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.28,0:16:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait. Wait a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.47,0:16:25.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}So … so now Crowley can just…what,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.42,0:16:27.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以想来就来了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}drop in whenever he feels like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.03,0:16:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我更想跟克劳力保持距离 远距离\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I prefer keeping Crowley at a distance. Long distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.76,0:16:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,真冷漠啊 小鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not very charitable, Moose…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.06,0:16:37.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其 我又再一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}…particularly since, once again,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.99,0:16:40.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,要救你们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm saving both your asses.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.86,0:16:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, as you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.95,0:16:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我暂时不能回我的宫殿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm temporarily persona non grata in my own palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.79,0:16:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 宫殿 - 宫殿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Palace? - Palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.42,0:16:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 还有些人依然受我控制 我的特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, there are those I still control. Operatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.19,0:16:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力 能不能有事说事 别装逼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley, can we just get the damn news without the drama?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.32,0:16:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你能不穿法兰绒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I get you without the flannel?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.30,0:16:56.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能 但我不也忍了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Still, I endure.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.19,0:16:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.82,0:17:01.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我根据一条线索 做了点调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did a little digging, acting on a tip.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.32,0:17:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为 我知道路西法最新皮囊是谁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think I know the identity of Lucifer's newest vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.31,0:17:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, for God's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.92,0:17:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.65,0:17:14.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是杰夫森·鲁尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I give you one Jefferson Rooney,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.72,0:17:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}President of these United States.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.38,0:17:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,您找我 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}You wanted to see me, Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.34,0:17:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,里克 出了点急事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, something urgent's come up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.72,0:17:43.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧急 而且机密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Urgent and…confidential.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.96,0:17:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.38,0:17:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,有可靠情报显示\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have reliable intel.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.37,0:17:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个精神不稳定的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that two mentally unstable individuals,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.50,0:17:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是邪教成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}possibly cult members,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.22,0:17:55.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备在这几天里刺杀我\N{\fnArial\fs30}have imminent plans to assassinate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.48,0:17:58.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.55,0:17:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我是撒旦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm Satan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.64,0:18:04.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们认为我是撒旦\N{\fnArial\fs30}They think I'm Satan.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.74,0:18:07.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是比喻性的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not metaphorically?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.31,0:18:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,撒旦本人\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the flesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.80,0:18:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,撒旦不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Satan's not real.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.97,0:18:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个嘛… - 他是傻瓜想出来的符号\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well… - He's a symbol for the simple-minded.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.02,0:18:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,漫画书里的恶人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A-a comic book villain.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.92,0:18:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,对很多人来说 他有更多意义 里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a bit more than that, Rick, to many people.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.90,0:18:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事我并不知情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't briefed on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.36,0:18:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这不就告诉你了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm briefing you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.77,0:18:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之前一直没有动作 等待更多消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been sitting on it until we had more facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.93,0:18:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了对我有明显的威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aside from the obvious peril to me…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.83,0:18:30.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会完全保密的 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll keep it strictly under the radar, Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.45,0:18:32.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得最好的方式就是消灭威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the best way to do that is to eliminate the threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.74,0:18:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.22,0:18:36.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以启动审批流程\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could initiate the approval process.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.89,0:18:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.22,0:18:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事我们得内部解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to handle this in the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.16,0:18:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,只限特勤局插手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secret Service only.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.05,0:18:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为我个人安保队的队长\N{\fnArial\fs30}And as the head of my personal detail,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.49,0:18:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要亲自带队处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will head this up yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.22,0:18:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.48,0:18:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢这份工作 里克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm liking this job, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.52,0:18:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想尽量多做一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna keep it a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.28,0:19:03.61,Note,0,0,0,0,,（米克·戴维斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.87,0:19:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我是米克·戴维斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello. Mick Davies here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.84,0:19:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,请留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave a mess…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.75,0:19:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算克劳力真找来了罗威娜 问题依旧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if Crowley does bring in Rowena, the problem remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.25,0:19:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法在皮囊里时不能被锁回笼子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer can't be returned to the cage inside his vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.89,0:19:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,得提取出他的精华\N{\fnArial\fs30}His essence has to be extracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.99,0:19:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 而且路西法找到了完美的安全屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. And Lucifer has found the perfect safe house.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.72,0:19:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要怎么接近总统啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, how do we even start getting close to the President?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.95,0:19:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好他不在华府\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it helps that he's not in D.C.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.04,0:19:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在中西部进行巡回筹款呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's, uh, actually on a fundraising swing through the Midwest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.68,0:19:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 看来他的整队人马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right now, it looks like his whole party …
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.91,0:19:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,助理 特勤局 所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}aides, Secret Service, the whole circus …
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.00,0:19:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,都住在罗恩·福斯特的一处宅邸\N{\fnArial\fs30}is staying at an estate owned by Ron Forester,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.45,0:19:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一个对冲基金亿万富翁\N{\fnArial\fs30}the, uh, hedge fund zillionaire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.70,0:19:49.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在印第安纳波利斯城外\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's right outside Indianapolis.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.67,0:19:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那里被高墙 安保人员 特勤局\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it is completely surrounded by walls, security,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.50,0:19:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,和军队层层包围\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secret Service, military.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.51,0:19:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,B计划呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plan B?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.19,0:20:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有好多演讲安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got a hell of a speaking schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.31,0:20:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天平均三次活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's averaging three events a day,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.64,0:20:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,周五晚还有晚宴\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he's got a gala dinner on Friday night.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.83,0:20:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少他会离开别墅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, at least he'll be outside of the mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.42,0:20:09.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但同时像希望钻石一样被护得周周全全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, guarded like the Hope Diamond.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.93,0:20:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,C计划呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plan C?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.63,0:20:16.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们呢 我们对彼此的感情呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about us? Our … our feelings for each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.92,0:20:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我对莫娜的事完全坦白\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why I've been totally up front about Mona.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.24,0:20:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫娜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mona?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.96,0:20:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫娜·莱文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mona Levin.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.83,0:20:25.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫娜·莱文\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mona Levin?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.31,0:20:26.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个女继承人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The heiress?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.02,0:20:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还跟她约会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been seen her as well?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.75,0:20:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道人总得多些选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know one has to keep one's options open.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.33,0:20:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,心意是控制不住的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The heart knows what the heart knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.82,0:20:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我的心意呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what does your heart know about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.02,0:20:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It knows that it's fond of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.49,0:20:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你的资历都无法查证\N{\fnArial\fs30}But your credentials were unverifiable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.94,0:20:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,金融控股 皇家芭蕾 都无法核实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Financial holdings, Royal Ballet, none of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.15,0:20:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还调查我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had me investigated?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.64,0:20:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在骗我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were scamming me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.78,0:20:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,好个五十步笑百步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, there's the pot calling the kettle black.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.74,0:20:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,可算来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.70,0:21:02.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,少上浆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Light starch.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.42,0:21:04.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我向一个穷光蛋敞开了心扉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I offered my heart to a pauper.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.35,0:21:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本就是想要我不存在的财产\N{\fnArial\fs30}who was after my nonexistent fortune!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.71,0:21:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是一样 亲爱的 我不过是挑明了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same as I did, sweetie. I'm just being honest about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.07,0:21:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是谁 - 我最新的未婚夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who is this? - My latest fiancé.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.74,0:21:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我把真相告诉莫娜呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I tell Mona the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.17,0:21:17.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会是头一遭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'd be a first.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.46,0:21:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 滚 - 这是我家\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get out! - It's my place!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.61,0:21:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.28,0:21:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,「母亲」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Mother"?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.40,0:21:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你为我做过的最好的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is the sweetest thing you've ever done for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.78,0:21:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,保证你不会笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise you won't laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.70,0:22:01.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕很好笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if it's funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.89,0:22:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.70,0:22:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚 我们俩 感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight, us here, it felt…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.53,0:22:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}different.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.78,0:22:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这下我真不想笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I'm really not laughing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.40,0:22:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.47,0:22:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还是很棒 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were great, as always, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.05,0:22:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}somehow…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.51,0:22:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我描述不上来\N{\fnArial\fs30}in some way I can't describe,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.62,0:22:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}it feels like…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.29,0:22:34.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像有什么变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}something's changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.70,0:22:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许是有什么变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe something has.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.65,0:23:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,小卡 小卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass? Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.31,0:23:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,出事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's happened. Something…
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.46,0:23:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,天使电台 有好多声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Angel radio… There are so many voices.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.42,0:23:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,都说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are they saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.12,0:23:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,天堂能量出现了强烈涌动\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's been a massive surge in celestial energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.41,0:23:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个拿非利人要诞生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A nephilim is come into being.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.66,0:23:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是天使和凡人的后代\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the offspring of an angel and a human.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.78,0:23:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是重大消息吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's big news?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.15,0:23:36.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 造成这个的能量很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but the power to produce this is immense.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.02,0:23:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,比一般的天使厉害的多\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's much, much greater than a typical angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.94,0:23:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.51,0:23:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}W… Lucifer?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.49,0:23:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不知道他在约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know he was dating.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.33,0:23:54.32,Note,0,0,0,0,,（印第安纳波利斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.89,0:23:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 克劳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and hey, Crowley?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.62,0:23:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你的政府内线问问\N{\fnArial\fs30}find out from your government mole if there's a.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.60,0:24:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是否有女友 情妇或宠爱的妓女\N{\fnArial\fs30}girlfriend or a mistress or a favorite hooker.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.25,0:24:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone we don't know about.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.09,0:24:05.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道了 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got it. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.11,0:24:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力和罗威娜会在印第安纳波利斯跟我们碰面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley and Rowena will meet us in Indianapolis.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.62,0:24:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,有计划了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we have a plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.06,0:24:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹劾总统路西法 并找到魔鬼圣婴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Impeach LOTUS and find Rosemary's Baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.47,0:24:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.76,0:24:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 待在这里 我们去\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Stay here. We got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.18,0:25:01.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生们 有什么问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen, is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.74,0:25:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是联邦探员 还得赶路呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Federal Agents, guys. We need to keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.67,0:25:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我周六前还得凑齐六千块呢 不照样没戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I need 6 grand by Saturday, but that ain't happening either.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.04,0:25:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们知道我们是谁吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys know who you're talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.97,0:25:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,温家兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Winchesters.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.64,0:25:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,假证是手工课上还是在精神病院里做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You make those toy badges in craft class on the psyche ward?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.27,0:25:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,车不错 非常显眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice car, by the way. Really stands out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.81,0:25:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a second now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.73,0:25:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,放了他 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him go. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.59,0:25:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.42,0:25:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别动 - 小卡 别\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't move! - ‭Cass, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.82,0:26:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 天使 抹去他们的记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You. Angel. Wipe their memories.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.86,0:26:47.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国政府牌照 精英猎狗人\N{\fnArial\fs30}U.S. Government plates. Elite dogcatcher level.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.60,0:26:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,有特别的人想抓你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone special wants you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.92,0:26:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是招惹谁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose hydrant have you lads been tinkling on?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.83,0:26:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.30,0:26:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我太没礼貌了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are my manners?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.91,0:27:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,亚瑟·凯奇 英国记录者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arthur Ketch. British Men of Letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.24,0:27:10.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实很简单的\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}So it's all very simple, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.15,0:27:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,米克·戴维斯邀你们加入我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mick Davies asked you to join our effort,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.95,0:27:14.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们打算进行国际化\N{\fnArial\fs30}which we're taking international.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.54,0:27:19.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的指示是 好好激励你们答应\N{\fnArial\fs30}My instructions are to strongly encourage a "Yes."
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.38,0:27:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你一直在跟踪我们吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what? You've just been following us?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.51,0:27:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是 我们是好狗 只有受召唤才会出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not at all. We're good dogs. We only come when called.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.08,0:27:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他打了电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he called.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.40,0:27:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.34,0:27:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I didn't, uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.91,0:27:33.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hung up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.64,0:27:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you did,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.09,0:27:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以戴维斯先生认为你们有了麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}which made Mr. Davies think that you were in trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.28,0:27:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他猜对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}which you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.65,0:27:41.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他打给了我 丁零当啷\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he rings me. Bing, bang, boom.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.25,0:27:42.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来就顺理成章了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meet Bob. He's your uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.55,0:27:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and, um, you're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.50,0:27:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为什么要相信你的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why should we believe anything that you have to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.12,0:27:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 光圈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, Halo.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.03,0:27:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我在说谎吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you sense I'm lying?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.07,0:27:58.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name is Castiel.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.82,0:28:04.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And… no.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.19,0:28:07.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但真话有时要看情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the truth can be situational.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.91,0:28:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就喜欢天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do enjoy an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:12.42,0:28:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我理解你们的迟疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I understand your hesitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.34,0:28:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们并没有看到我们最好的一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}You haven't exactly seen us at our best.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.05,0:28:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝维尔夫人有点 容易激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady Bevell is a bit… excitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.40,0:28:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她企图杀我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}She tried to kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.31,0:28:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我说了 容易激动 - 你就强点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like I said, excitable. - And you're better?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.71,0:28:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我既不喜欢你们 也不讨厌你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care about you one way or the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.45,0:28:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是空想家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not an ideologue.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.95,0:28:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只想帮助这对儿美国猎人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all you wanna do is help these American Hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.80,0:28:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,清理这个国家的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}to clear this country of monsters?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.17,0:28:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们理解这里的情况不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We understand things are different here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.54,0:28:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们愿意合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're eager to collaborate.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.49,0:28:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,英国记录者有数世纪的历史 各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}The British Men of Letters are centuries old, lads.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.23,0:28:45.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以提供专业知识\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can offer expertise,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.71,0:28:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,武器 技艺\N{\fnArial\fs30}weaponry, skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.55,0:28:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像刚刚那样的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like we saw out on the road?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.29,0:28:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个艺术家 温彻斯特先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an artist, Mr. Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.02,0:28:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用很多颜色作画\N{\fnArial\fs30}I paint in many colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.81,0:28:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚那是枪榴弹发射器吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that a grenade launcher?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.24,0:28:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.46,0:29:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的工程师花费数年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our engineers have spent years.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.28,0:29:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,融合巫术和科技\N{\fnArial\fs30}blending sorcery and technology.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.04,0:29:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如 我们并不总砍吸血鬼的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}For instance, we don't always decapitate vampires.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.70,0:29:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,不够高效 尤其是对大血巢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inefficient, reallea especially for large nests.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.93,0:29:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们辐射他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We irradiate them,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.97,0:29:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,改变他们的DNA\N{\fnArial\fs30}reorder their DNA.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.80,0:29:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们的血液变成致命毒物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their own blood becomes lethal to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.65,0:29:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.92,0:29:30.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩具最好玩了 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The toys are the fun part, hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.59,0:29:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,双曲线脉冲发生器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hyperbolic Pulse Generator.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.33,0:29:40.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,驱魔很不靠谱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exorcisms are unreliable.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.67,0:29:42.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这件装置能放出一股力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}This device emits a force.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.30,0:29:46.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,迫使附身的恶魔离开皮囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}which drives the possessing demon from the vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.91,0:29:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那附身的天使呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about a, uh, possessing angel?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.29,0:29:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在追查什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what might you boys be working on?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.04,0:29:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想要我们信任你 就得先信任我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want us to trust you, you're gonna have to trust us first.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.36,0:30:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.06,0:30:07.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要用那个把路西法从总统身体里赶出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're gonna pop Lucifer out of the President with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.75,0:30:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望能行 否则我们死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope so. Otherwise, we're all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.34,0:30:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后让罗威娜把他送回笼子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then Rowena zaps him back to the cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.78,0:30:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我们得先把他弄来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, we gotta get him here first.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.77,0:30:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我们得找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. We need to get ahold of this,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.15,0:30:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力查到的秘密女友\N{\fnArial\fs30}secret girlfriend Crowley found out about. This…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.40,0:30:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.12,0:30:25.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 她跟总统一起在别墅里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, she's in that mansion with the President,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.14,0:30:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里戒备森严\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is guarded like a fortress.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.19,0:30:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们中只有一人有可能进得去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only one of us has a chance of getting in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.07,0:30:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bollocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.77,0:30:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我怀孕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I'm pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.76,0:30:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道什么时候 谢丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know when, Sheri.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.42,0:30:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不知道怎么会 只知道我是怀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how. I just know that I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.30,0:30:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, darling.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.89,0:30:53.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会有点疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is going to sting a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.71,0:30:59.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 你们骗人 这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, you're making it up. It's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.31,0:31:04.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 瞬移不也是不可能的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, to be fair, so is teleporting. But…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.15,0:31:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你在这儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}ta-da.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.89,0:31:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you people?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.30,0:31:12.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我是个女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, dear, I'm a witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.22,0:31:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.33,0:31:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是地狱之王\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm the King of Hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.07,0:31:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.12,0:31:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 他走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, actually, he left.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.14,0:31:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 帮倒忙呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, guys, not helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.30,0:31:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能 他是总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}You … you can't. He's the President.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.87,0:31:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他原来是 但现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was, but now…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.90,0:31:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道他的行为没有变化吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me he hasn't been acting different.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.86,0:31:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰夫最近压力很大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeff's been under a lot of stress. He…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.69,0:31:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他是魔鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrong. He's the Devil.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.25,0:31:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,长角 干草叉 全套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Horns, pitchfork, the whole nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.09,0:31:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,克劳力 还是帮倒忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crowley, still not helping.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.50,0:31:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们清楚自己在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, we know what we're talking about here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.54,0:31:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们查路西法很久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have been on Lucifer's trail for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.82,0:31:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道你怀了他的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we know you're pregnant with his child.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.56,0:31:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…你们撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's … that's … you're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.56,0:31:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你体内的东西 是不洁的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing inside you, it's unholy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.54,0:32:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是恶果\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an abomination.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.66,0:32:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's n…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.27,0:32:04.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手放在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Place your hand here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.14,0:32:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.85,0:32:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. ‭
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.18,0:32:35.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道你怀孕了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does he even know you're knocked up?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.46,0:32:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, he…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.57,0:32:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说他很激动\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he was thrilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.00,0:32:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说这是他唯一一次创造了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said it was the only time he ever created anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.08,0:32:47.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.64,0:32:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}we need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.92,0:32:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我赦免…\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I grant a full pardon…"
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.75,0:33:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,查尔斯·曼森「\N{\fnArial\fs30}"…to Charles Manson."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.88,0:33:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.34,0:33:28.35,Note,0,0,0,0,,（平原旅馆）
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.12,0:33:33.68,Note,0,0,0,0,,（平原旅馆）
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.17,0:33:42.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 我们照您说的 只有小队人跟随\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir, we agreed to keep this small like you asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.15,0:33:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在进去 快速检查一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna go inside, run a quick sweep.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.52,0:33:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.26,0:33:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,可不希望我出事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't want anything happening to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.60,0:33:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,克莱恩小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ms. Kline.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.58,0:34:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里只有凯莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no one in here but Kelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.74,0:34:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,去车里等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go wait in your car.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.43,0:34:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.04,0:34:35.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.44,0:34:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面只有凯莉 我们在车里等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no one in there but Kelly. We'll wait in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.71,0:35:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.36,0:35:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯莉 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.93,0:35:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在电话上跟你说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.60,0:35:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能把孩子生下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't have this baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.99,0:35:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恐怕要坚持\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid I'll have to insist.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.61,0:35:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.41,0:35:41.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.26,0:35:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一套我们玩过那么多次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've done this dance so many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.04,0:35:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.34,0:35:56.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.59,0:36:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗威娜 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rowena, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.79,0:36:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.26,0:36:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事没完 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't over, Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.92,0:36:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,下地狱去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to Hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.80,0:36:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.51,0:36:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.89,0:37:21.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还活着 他什么都不会记得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's alive. He won't remember a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.45,0:37:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰夫 天呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeff. Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.97,0:37:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeff?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.92,0:37:30.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天呐 - 我们得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God. - We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.39,0:37:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,带她离开 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get her out of here. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.76,0:37:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯莉 你得走了 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly, you gotta go. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.33,0:37:46.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们抓到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.93,0:37:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们抓到路西法了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.23,0:38:08.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\*}Mr. President?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.19,0:38:12.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 没事的 慢慢来 猛男\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. All right. Take it easy, Tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.55,0:38:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,总统先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. President!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.18,0:38:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,站起来 手举过头顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}On your feet! Hands on your heads!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.86,0:38:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,手举过头顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}‭Hands on your heads!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.62,0:38:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听着 我们是想 - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, listen, we were just trying to - ‭Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.08,0:38:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们因企图行刺美国总统\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're under arrest for the attempted assassination.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.29,0:38:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,被捕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the President of the United States.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.79,0:39:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我…需要点时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I just… I need a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.17,0:40:17.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（女厕）
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.19,0:40:19.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.75,0:40:25.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯莉 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.32,0:40:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.23,0:40:38.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂 - 卡西迪奥\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - Castiel…
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.45,0:40:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.60,0:40:42.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.20,0:40:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能感觉到它在我体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can feel it inside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.90,0:40:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是它的母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm its mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.93,0:40:50.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯莉 听我说 那不是个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kelly, you listen to me. This is not a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.06,0:40:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是路西法的后代\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the spawn of Lucifer.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.50,0:40:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my child.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.17,0:40:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 凯莉 你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Kelly, you…
